{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction to Spooky Fun Park &quot;Spooky Fun Park&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Spooky Fun Park&quot; is a simulation management puzzle game where you step into the role of a staff member at an amusement park. Immersed in an atmosphere of Chinese dreamcore, the game presents the bizarre story of the park through a retro art style. What strange encounters await you here? Why does the mist appear, and what caused the mysterious disappearance of 28 people? Through meticulous environmental interaction, surveillance investigation, and continuous revelation of secrets, you will personally experience this nightmare that gradually erodes your sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Responsibilities: Day and Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work is split into two interconnected shifts that drive the game\u2019s progression:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Shift: Ticket Inspection</strong><br>Verify visitors\u2019 identities and tickets at the entrance booth. Follow the ever-changing <i>Park Entry Guidelines</i> to decide whom to admit or turn away. But beware\u2014the rules themselves may be contradictory, and your choices will set the stage for the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Patrol</strong><br>When darkness falls, the park\u2019s atmosphere shifts entirely. Using static-filled surveillance screens, you must monitor the grounds and venture out personally to handle supernatural phenomena triggered by your daytime decisions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069670?t=1773287502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069670/d9c89ec00eeb36a0805310a9e798a070ec13c350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773287502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a