 personally to handle supernatural phenomena triggered by your daytime decisions.</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069670/f2ab7942096737a8442d9bbbe54f1d10eae2028d/header.jpg?t=1773287502","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069670/848313360/27f9692927c4980e3366ddfac6f19eb7bb9e956f/1767342771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767345748","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069670/848313360/27f9692927c4980e3366ddfac6f19eb7bb9e956f/1767342771/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767345748","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069670/848313360/27f9692927c4980e3366ddfac6f19eb7bb9e956f/1767342771/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767345748","id":257224929,"name":"\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224929/b67c2ada7d7de83257d98dc5a8eac18795724d15/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767345748"}],"name":"Spooky Fun Park","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 5 from around 2016 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580 or newer</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro